sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Current page
    participant C as Controller if data not loaded
    participant DB as SQL table: selected dataset
    participant XLS as ExcelJS / Browser download

    Admin->>UI: Click Export Excel
    UI->>UI: Check selected data to export

    alt Data is already loaded in the interface
        UI->>UI: Prepare rows from current page data
    else Full dataset must be fetched first
        UI->>C: Request complete export rows
        C->>DB: Read selected dataset<br/>stops/causes/metrage/vitesse
        DB-->>C: Rows
        C-->>UI: Complete rows
    end

    UI->>XLS: Build workbook and worksheet
    XLS-->>UI: Generated .xlsx file
    UI-->>Admin: Browser downloads Excel file

    alt No exportable data or generation error
        UI-->>Admin: Show export error message
    end
